masks and all that stuff.

00:09:53.424 --> 00:09:56.287
So along with that, we will be going back

00:09:56.287 --> 00:09:58.537
into the Ear Biscuit Studio with the

00:09:58.537 --> 00:10:01.029
Round Table of Dim Lighting.
Hallejuah!

00:10:01.029 --> 00:10:03.395
So the echo that you hear,

00:10:03.395 --> 00:10:06.206
especially on my side will be gone.

00:10:06.206 --> 00:10:07.039
The USB audio quality,

00:10:07.039 --> 00:10:11.726
which I've seen some audiophiles
actually complain about

00:10:11.726 --> 00:10:14.092
because we're using these USB mics,

00:10:14.092 --> 00:10:15.395
that'll be gone.

00:10:15.395 --> 00:10:18.517
We're going XLR all the way, all the time.

00:10:18.517 --> 00:10:19.739
Mm-hmm.

00:10:19.739 --> 00:10:21.980
So we'll be back to the way it should be.

00:10:21.980 --> 00:10:24.839
The way it needs to be.
And we can smell each other.

00:10:24.839 --> 00:10:26.226
Don't forget about that.

00:10:26.226 --> 00:10:27.476
That's the biggest part.
We can smell each other.

00:10:27.476 --> 00:10:30.382
I was gonna let you mention that.

00:10:30.382 --> 00:10:33.067
We can see each other directly

00:10:33.067 --> 00:10:36.324
versus through screens.
And there will be no delay.

00:10:36.324 --> 00:10:37.592
And we have shot,

00:10:37.592 --> 00:10:41.384
so yesterday we went in and we shot,

00:10:41.384 --> 00:10:44.134
a few episodes of GMM with Stevie

00:10:45.126 --> 00:10:48.373
and it was a joy, was it not?

00:10:48.373 --> 00:10:51.230
Yeah, I mean, yeah, I was,

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:54.130
I mean, I think I said it in
one of the episodes that like,

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:57.873
I had a hard time
sleeping the night before,

00:10:57.873 --> 00:11:00.623
