00:11:31.634 --> 00:11:34.217
And so they were all on,

00:11:34.217 --> 00:11:36.538
Morgan and the rest of the crew

00:11:36.538 --> 00:11:39.140
that was needed for all the episodes

00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:42.395
